2026-04-24 13:03:31 | INFO | trailerplace.thinking | THINKING_FLOW_SOURCE | session_id=50854aea-66b2-4b34-80c3-a1959ceb617a | payload={"user_message": "now I am looking for a livestock with goose neck", "assistant_message": "Here are some livestock trailers with a gooseneck hitch:\n\n1. [2026 Gooseneck 16\u2019X6\u20198'' Livestock - 91173](https://www.trailerplace.com/inventory/2026-gooseneck-16x68-livestock-91173/)\n\n\u2022Price: $11,800  \n\u2022Length: 16 ft  \n\u2022GVWR: 12,500 lbs  \n\u2022Payload Capacity: 8,595 lbs  \n\u2022Hitch Type: Gooseneck  \n\u2022Color: Black  \n\nThis gooseneck livestock trailer offers substantial payload capacity, making it ideal for transporting livestock securely and effectively.\n\n2. [2026 Gooseneck Bp Alum Cattle Trailer - 91134](https://www.trailerplace.com/inventory/2026-gooseneck-bp-alum-cattle-trailer-91134/)\n\n\u2022Price: $22,114  \n\u2022Length: 16 ft  \n\u2022GVWR: 12,500 lbs  \n\u2022Payload Capacity: 9,415 lbs  \n\u2022Hitch Type: Gooseneck  \n\u2022Color: Aluminum  \n\nConstructed from aluminum, this cattle trailer is lightweight and durable, providing an excellent payload capacity for your livestock needs.\n\n3. [2026 Galyean Cattle Trailer W/Butterfly Gates 24' - 15181](https://www.trailerplace.com/inventory/2026-galyean-cattle-trailer-w-butterfly-gates-24-15181/)\n\n\u2022Price: $23,995  \n\u2022Length: 24 ft  \n\u2022GVWR: 17,150 lbs  \n\u2022Payload Capacity: 10,170 lbs  \n\u2022Hitch Type: Gooseneck  \n\u2022Color: Black  \n\nThis larger trailer features butterfly gates for accessibility and comes with an impressive payload capacity for hauling multiple cattle comfortably.\n\nUnfortunately, the trailers I found include a higher payload capacity than you might need, but they provide great options for livestock transport. Let me know if any of these catch your interest, or if you'd like to explore more!", "conversation_window": [{"role": "user", "content": "nope"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Based on w